#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: ana bēliya 
#tr.en: To my lord 
2. qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.ts: qibima 
#tr.en: speak! 
3. um-ma as3-qu2-du-um 
#tr.ts: umma Asqudum 
#tr.en: Thus Asqudum, 
4. _ARAD2_-ka-a-ma 
#tr.ts: waradkama 
#tr.en: your servant: 
