7. e-pu-usz2-ma la-ap-ta 
#tr.ts: epušma laptā 
#tr.en: I did, and they are not favorable. 
8. a-ta-ar e-pe2-es3-su2-nu-szi-ma 
#tr.ts: atâr eppessunūšima 
#tr.en: I will again do for them. 
