5. u3 ne2-ke-me2-tum ma-la 
#tr.ts: u nēkemētum mala 
#tr.en: And the stunted parts, whatever 
6. i-na ni-qi2 be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: ina nīqī bēliya 
